        "original_id": "dc1c22a5-a8d3-531e-9735-dfa4c8f71636",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Seasons/Shows: The Celebrity Apprentice 3, The Apprentice 9, Celebrity Apprentice\n- Companies/Organizations: NBC, Billboard Hot 100\n- People: Bret Michaels\n- Bands: Poison\n- Songs: Every Rose Has Its Thorn\n\nFacts:\n- On April 29, 2009, NBC officially announced that Celebrity Apprentice would be renewed for Spring 2010.\n- The Celebrity Apprentice 3, also known as The Apprentice 9, is the ninth installment of the reality game show Celebrity Apprentice.\n- The show The Celebrity Apprentice 3 premiered on Sunday, March 14, 2010.\n- On Sunday, May 23, 2010, the two-hour finale of The Celebrity Apprentice 3 aired from 9 to 11 p.m. ET/PT, and Bret Michaels won the season.\n- Bret Michael Sychak, professionally known as Bret Michaels, was born on March 15, 1963, and is an American singer-songwriter and musician.\n- Poison has had ten singles reach the Top 40 of the Billboard Hot 100, including six Top 10 singles and the number-one song Every Rose Has Its Thorn.",
